{"step_index":1563,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:56:57Z","thinking":"**Determining P6's Radius**\n\nExamining P6, window size W equals 4, and node labels f are (0, 2, 0, 0, 2, 0). Identified the centers as 1 and 4, each having eccentricity 4, which is greater than W-1.\n\nVertices 2 and 3 exhibit eccentricity 3, which is less than or equal to W-1, and these vertices have label 0. Deducted the radius of P6 to be 3.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python3 -c \"\nimport itertools\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef bfs_ecc(adj, n, v):\n    dist = {v: 0}\n    q = deque([v])\n    while q:\n        curr = q.popleft()\n        for nxt in adj[curr]:\n            if nxt not in dist:\n                dist[nxt] = dist[curr] + 1\n                q.append(nxt)\n    if len(dist) < n:\n        return None\n    return max(dist.values())\n\n# Let's test all trees on n=8, 9, 10\nimport random\nfailed = 0\nfor n in [7, 8, 9, 10]:\n    for trial in range(50):\n        prufer = [random.randint(0, n - 1) for _ in range(n - 2)]\n        deg = [1] * n\n        for x in prufer:\n            deg[x] += 1\n        adj = {i: [] for i in range(n)}\n        for x in prufer:\n            for y in range(n):\n                if deg[y] == 1:\n                    adj[x].append(y)\n                    adj[y].append(x)\n                    deg[x] -= 1\n                    deg[y] -= 1\n                    break\n        u, v = [i for i in range(n) if deg[i] == 1]\n        adj[u].append(v)\n        adj[v].append(u)\n        rad = min(bfs_ecc(adj, n, i) for i in range(n))\n        # Find all minimal Roman dominating functions\n        # Check if rad + 1 <= W for all f\n        # We can just sample random Roman dominating functions or check all\n        # To be fast, check min W (rdn)\n        # If rad + 1 <= rdn, then rad + 1 <= W for ALL f!\n        # Because W >= rdn!\n        pass\nprint('Ready to verify rad + 1 <= rdn')\n\"","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Setup fast rdn verification","toolSummary":"Fast rdn check"}}]}
